    <string name="recursive_harness_backup_description" translatable="false">Save every genome, its report, the archive and the active pointer as one JSON file outside the app, so a reinstall can never wipe them. Import restores only through the existing checks and never activates anything — re-promote through the normal approval if you want a genome active again.</string>
