    <string name="recursive_harness_archive_kept" translatable="false">The list keeps the best 10 entries plus the active genome\'s lineage and the last run\'s candidate; older rows are pruned automatically after each run. Deleting a row only removes it from the list — the genome and its report stay saved and exportable.</string>
